        "node_id": "n_1_cdd67a",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous reasoning was in the instability calculation. The correct approach is to consider the maximum of the leftmost element and the rightmost element after removing each element, rather than the difference between the rightmost and leftmost elements. This allows for a more accurate calculation of the minimum possible instability after removing one element.",
