        "node_id": "n_2_933b30",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous reasoning was that the loop condition in the `min_instability` function was incorrect, causing the function to miss the last element when calculating the instability after removing each element. By changing the loop condition to `i < n - 1`, we ensure that all elements are considered for removal, leading to the correct calculation of the minimum instability.",
