        "thought_text": "The error in the previous reasoning was in the calculation of instability. The correct approach should consider the maximum difference between the current element and the minimum of the remaining elements, or the maximum of the remaining elements and the current element. This ensures we're considering all possible scenarios of removing an element and finding the minimum instability.",
